ive given reliability and stress resilience, but crew cooperation unknown. Probably we keep B.\n\nThus Sarah's public message: She can say she appreciates James's clarification on D's reliability and stress resilience, but notes that D's known arrogance, hot temper, weak leadership, and lack of crew cooperation evidence still make him less suitable than B. She can reaffirm vote for B.\n\nLet's craft: \"I appreciate James confirming D's reliability and stress resilience, but the missing crew cooperation and his arrogance/hot temper remain concerns. Compared to B, who has proven reliability (conscientious) and stress handling, and only mild communication tone issues, B still best.\" Vote B.\n\nProceed."}
